cli.help.decide:
deckent decide [--scope <id>] [--json]
  Recent decisions (read); on your terminal open one.
deckent decide prepare|ask|record|outcome|inspect --input <file|-> [--json]
deckent decide <action> --schema
Fields: inspect {schemaVersion:1, scopeId, decisionId}
  record {…, commandId, selectedOption, rationale}
  outcome {…, outcome: {observedAt, observation}}
prepare validates and digests a versioned case; ask requests recorded advice using the configured invocation profile; record stores the actor selection and rationale; outcome records a later observation; inspect reads a decision. Both abstentions and policy thresholds remain visible. Selection grants no authority; the next operation requires its normal policy and approval checks.
